# Allow-list for the `tom_ai` build context: everything is excluded, then
# the packages the advanced servers resolve by path are admitted back.
*
!core/tom_core_kernel
!core/tom_core_server
!core/tom_core_samples/advanced_todo_contracts
!core/tom_core_samples/advanced_todo_domain
!core/tom_core_samples/advanced_app_server
!core/tom_core_samples/advanced_auth_server
!core/tom_core_samples/advanced_ops_server
!reflection/tom_reflection_generator
!core_extension/tom_core_openapi

# Inside them: no build state, no machine-local resolution, no tests,
# examples or documents — the image is built from what a clone holds.
**/.dart_tool
**/build
**/testlog
**/pubspec.lock
**/.env
**/test
**/example
**/doc
